  "description": "Removal of Condition 12 (Restrictions on use of Rear Parking and Loading Areas) of planning permission ref. 1902/APP/2005/2370 dated 23-11-2005. Erection of an industrial unit for B1(Business, B2(General Industrial) and/or B8 (Storage and Distribution use)(Involving demolition of Units 7 and 7a).",
  "subdivision_of_building": null,
  "actual_completion_date": null,
